the Cloud Markdown<->ADF functions with marklas (plus its transitive mistune) as a pinned OPTIONAL EXTRA, lazily imported ... routed to the existing plain-text adf.py fallback' — establishing marklas+mistune as the family's chosen Markdown engine and precedent","rebar:3388 declares 'depends_on' both 271c (this plan) and e59d, so the two engines coexist in the same jira_family package after cutover","resolve_symbol: pypandoc UNRESOLVED (not currently installed) — pypandoc-binary is a genuinely new, heavier dependency, not one already present","Anti-FP (Justified-Complexity): marklas targets ADF/JSON while DC needs wiki markup via pandoc's commonmark->jira writer — a plausible real distinction the plan should affirmatively state rather than leave implicit"],"finding":"The plan adds a second heavy Markdown-conversion engine (pypandoc-binary==1.15 / bundled pandoc 3.6.1) to the jira_family adapter without reconciling that choice against the family's already-adopted marklas+mistune engine, which the sibling Cloud converter (story e59d, on which the downstream cutover story 3388 depends) ships as a lazy optional extra. The alternatives analysis weighs only three jira-specific libraries (md-to-jira, mistune-jira, md-jira) and never explains why the family's existing Markdown engine cannot serve the DC wiki target — leaving two parallel Markdown engines in one adapter family with the divergence unjustified in the plan text.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fdbd9fb101b3a5757","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan sections 'Problem' and 'Renderer contract' / 'Dependency/CI' (the 'wiki = [\"pypandoc-binary==1.15\"]' extra and the 'md-to-jira, mistune-jira, and md-jira lack equivalent fidelity' sentence)","norm_id":"n092ebb12ed4cdcfd","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","scenarios":["A maintainer must reason about two distinct Markdown parse/convert engines (pandoc vs marklas+mistune) within one jira_family adapter, doubling the fidelity/round-trip/edge-case surface","A future reviewer of ADR 0095 cannot tell whether marklas was rejected for the wiki target on technical grounds or simply not considered"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"Add one line to the 'Problem'/alternatives text and ADR 0095: e.g. 'marklas/mistune (the family's Cloud ADF engine, story e59d) targets ADF JSON and has no Jira-wiki writer; pandoc's commonmark->jira --wrap=none is the only maintained path to DC wiki markup, so the two engines are complementary, not redundant.'","tier":"LLM","validity":0.25,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P4"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":[],"finding":"Ticket description exceeds the review admission limit.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f8512ab0ae8f2386f","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"nb0ae2ede5f5caf65","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","scenarios":[],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"Reduce the description to at most 8000 characters, usually by splitting independent work 